{"4479040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wood Goes BRRR", "steam_appid": 4479040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wood Goes BRRR is a chaotic 1–4 player co-op.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hustle at the Dam, survive the daily beaver struggle, and hit the Big OG Boss’s quota. But watch your back - if things go south, you’ll have to literally fight your friends for the right to keep your job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you crush the quota, or end up as just another unemployed beaver?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/ed35f0deb8b281136c26fd83c84c2fa4.poster.avif?t=1787751421\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/ed35f0deb8b281136c26fd83c84c2fa4.webm?t=1787751421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/ed35f0deb8b281136c26fd83c84c2fa4.mp4?t=1787751421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTHING GOES TO PLAN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some days it burns, some days it pours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Boss doesn’t care. Quota’s a quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/b9e99d13632b3f8f18d181c0dd6fb4d3.poster.avif?t=1787751421\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/b9e99d13632b3f8f18d181c0dd6fb4d3.webm?t=1787751421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/b9e99d13632b3f8f18d181c0dd6fb4d3.mp4?t=1787751421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLANT IT. CHEW IT. SELL IT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow the trees, gnaw them down, haul the logs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The buyers are penguins. Don’t ask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/85fbfaac2ba971145ac0083227e3d057.poster.avif?t=1787751421\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/85fbfaac2ba971145ac0083227e3d057.webm?t=1787751421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/85fbfaac2ba971145ac0083227e3d057.mp4?t=1787751421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PUSH YOUR LUCK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fastest way to reach your quota? The casino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fastest way to get kicked out of the team? Gambling with their money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/9023c85c52077fb461575b92137e2b6a.poster.avif?t=1787751421\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/9023c85c52077fb461575b92137e2b6a.webm?t=1787751421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/9023c85c52077fb461575b92137e2b6a.mp4?t=1787751421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BEAVER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re getting fired, at least leave with the drip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blind your Boss with that style.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wood Goes BRRR is a chaotic 1–4 player co-op.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hustle at the Dam, survive the daily beaver struggle, and hit the Big OG Boss’s quota. But watch your back - if things go south, you’ll have to literally fight your friends for the right to keep your job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you crush the quota, or end up as just another unemployed beaver?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/ed35f0deb8b281136c26fd83c84c2fa4.poster.avif?t=1787751421\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/ed35f0deb8b281136c26fd83c84c2fa4.webm?t=1787751421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/ed35f0deb8b281136c26fd83c84c2fa4.mp4?t=1787751421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTHING GOES TO PLAN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some days it burns, some days it pours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Boss doesn’t care. Quota’s a quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/b9e99d13632b3f8f18d181c0dd6fb4d3.poster.avif?t=1787751421\" width=780 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/b9e99d13632b3f8f18d181c0dd6fb4d3.webm?t=1787751421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4479040/extras/b9e99d13632b3